1
00:00:00,023 --> 00:00:01,853
It's an incredible experience.

2
00:00:01,853 --> 00:00:04,500
It even changed my life a little.

3
00:00:07,487 --> 00:00:10,867
My name is Juliana, I'm Colombian.

4
00:00:10,867 --> 00:00:13,667
I arrived in August 2025.

5
00:00:13,683 --> 00:00:17,267
I started at A2, now I'm at C1.

6
00:00:19,483 --> 00:00:22,083
I wanted to study here, in France,

7
00:00:22,083 --> 00:00:24,883
to continue my studies here.

8
00:00:24,883 --> 00:00:26,933
So I decided to learn French.

9
00:00:27,083 --> 00:00:29,583
And I found it's easier

10
00:00:29,583 --> 00:00:31,533
and more efficient to do it in France.

11
00:00:31,533 --> 00:00:34,133
We have lots of chances to practice.

12
00:00:34,133 --> 00:00:35,783
Not only in class,

13
00:00:35,783 --> 00:00:39,533
but at the supermarket, at restaurants…

14
00:00:42,187 --> 00:00:44,617
All the teachers are really nice,

15
00:00:44,617 --> 00:00:47,067
and they help us.

16
00:00:47,073 --> 00:00:50,583
It's great, because we always feel

17
00:00:50,583 --> 00:00:54,133
supported, not alone in this experience.

18
00:00:56,350 --> 00:00:59,720
When we played board games,

19
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:02,800
we really laughed, we had so much fun.

20
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:04,650
And at the same time, we were learning…

21
00:01:04,650 --> 00:01:07,867
I think it was direct and indirect objects.

22
00:01:07,883 --> 00:01:10,983
It's really fun, we laugh a lot,

23
00:01:10,983 --> 00:01:12,833
but we also learn a lot.

24
00:01:15,267 --> 00:01:19,017
I went to a wine cellar in Lyon,

25
00:01:19,017 --> 00:01:22,087
to eat cheese and drink wine.

26
00:01:22,087 --> 00:01:23,567
It was really interesting,

27
00:01:23,567 --> 00:01:26,267
we learned the whole process.

28
00:01:26,297 --> 00:01:30,067
It's amazing to see things face to face,

29
00:01:30,067 --> 00:01:32,733
not just online, in a picture.

30
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,200
I like Lyon because it's calm,

31
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,600
but there's a lot to do:

32
00:01:38,687 --> 00:01:41,200
museums, restaurants…

33
00:01:41,307 --> 00:01:43,500
So it's really great.

34
00:01:45,723 --> 00:01:47,553
It's an incredible experience.

35
00:01:47,553 --> 00:01:49,733
It even changed my life a little.

36
00:01:49,750 --> 00:01:52,767
So I recommend it, you'll see!
